1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:13,840
Being a black billionaire is not success. It's assimilation. What I mean

2
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:22,660
is that the concept of success is very different depending on what you believe in.

3
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:31,020
Now, if capitalism is what drives you, then her being a billionaire is why she's successful.

4
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:43,120
If, you know, ambition and achievement is what drives you, then her having a goal of getting a TV show

5
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:49,980
and then that show garnering a high level of viewership, then that's what makes you successful.

6
00:00:50,760 --> 00:01:03,810
But you can do that and not be a billionaire. You follow? The level of money that you have

7
00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:11,790
is not, in my opinion, the determiner of the success. It means that you were able to function

8
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:19,430
within the capitalist framework at a level that was a high level. And by the way, this also doesn't

9
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:23,510
mean you're smart. I know some people think that because people made money that they're smart. No,

10
00:01:23,570 --> 00:01:28,590
they're good at making money. Capitalism does not require you to be an intellectual. It requires you

11
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:34,810
to be good at making money. And that is a very specific skill. I know a lot of dumb millionaires.

12
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:43,010
A lot. The thing that I want to point out though is just because you received the money

13
00:01:43,010 --> 00:01:49,750
doesn't make you a billionaire. What made you a billionaire was hoarding the money.

14
00:01:49,750 --> 00:01:58,470
So when we talk about success, I don't believe that we should measure it on how much money you've

15
00:01:58,470 --> 00:02:09,610
hoarded. I believe success should not be measured on money at all, but more so on what you have been

16
00:02:09,610 --> 00:02:19,250
able to achieve inwardly and outwardly for your community in doing so. There is no reason anybody

17
00:02:19,250 --> 00:02:26,510
should be a billionaire while people can't eat. And I know that there are Black people in this

18
00:02:26,510 --> 00:02:33,490
country who will say, oh, how dare you, Amanda? And you can how dare me all you want. Because at the

19
00:02:33,490 --> 00:02:40,290
end of the day, none of that money has made it easier for Black people to not get killed in this

20
00:02:40,290 --> 00:02:44,050
country for being Black. Right? Exactly.

